James 5:1 , Wicked rich men are to fear God's vengeance;
James 5:7 , We ought to be patient in afflictions, after the example of the prophets, and Job;
James 5:12 , to forbear swearing;
James 5:13 , to pray in adversity, to sing in prosperity;
James 5:14 , to acknowledge mutually our several faults, to pray one for another;
James 5:19 , and to reduce a straying brother to the truth.
